## 🚀 Installation

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <your-repository-url>
```

Navigate into the project directory:

```bash
cd <project-directory>
```

Install the dependency:

```bash
pip install cryptography
```

Run the program:

```bash
python3 encryption_program.py
```

